65
00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:04.180
You could realize that it was starting to be a different company, more corporate.

66
00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:09.560
That's why I thought it was time to move to a different place or to have a break.

67
00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:13.800
And what I found at FTX was the early Binance.

68
00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:18.660
Even though FTX was huge, was the second biggest exchange and was growing really fast,

69
00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.540
