70
00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:22.780
Binance was more or less 8,000.

71
00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:28.660
So only 400 people were doing more or less the job of 8,000 people at Binance.

72
00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:30.200
