140
00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:53.480
So I think to make money is one of the reasons, but also because it's my hobby.

141
00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:54.160
I like it.

142
00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:55.780
I like what crypto means.

143
00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:59.060
I like the philosophy of this ecosystem.

144
