206
00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:37.880
Why is that?

207
00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:38.860
What's your take on this?

208
00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:41.940
In crypto, options trading is very small, still very small.

209
00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.480
In the future, this trend will change.

210
00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:48.640
And options will be a huge percentage of the crypto trading volume.

211
00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:51.420
So that's why I wanted to jump in early.

212
00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:56.480
When people start realizing that options are less risky and are not that difficult, they

213
00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:57.880
