214
00:11:58.100 --> 00:11:59.480
Is that your personal preference as well?

215
00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:00.200
Right now, yes.

216
00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:02.940
I mean, before CoinCall, I was only trading futures.

217
00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:07.880
But since I joined CoinCall, I started learning about options because I have to say that I didn't

218
00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:08.940
