219
00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:12.240
I mean, I knew what options were, but I didn't trade options.

220
00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:17.880
This vision that CoinCall has convinced me and also the data on traditional finance, it's

221
00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:18.900
