222
00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.700
Options is a huge part of the market.

223
00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:25.780
Because I have a few friends that are option traders and honestly, they work an hour a day.

224
00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:27.600
And I'm like, how do you even do that?

225
00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:29.440
I'm so jealous.

226
00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:30.320
Right.

227
00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:31.300
That's another thing.

228
00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:35.220
You don't need to pay attention all the time to be liquidated for market moves or things

229
00:12:35.220 --> 00:12:38.340
like this because you have an expiration date in your options contract.

230
00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:44.980
And until that date, you can decide if you do the purchase or not of this option.

231
00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:50.700
Let's talk about futures first.

232
00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:55.680
What are the data and stats you will look out for before you start a trade?

233
00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:59.680
Well, I would say first what cryptocurrency I want to trade.

234
00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:03.260
