237
00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:13.760
How are they positioned it?

238
00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:14.740
And many things.

239
00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:16.400
It depends on each crypto.

240
00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:23.540
So what's your approach on setting stop losses?

241
00:13:24.140 --> 00:13:26.800
Why is it so hard for people to admit that they're wrong?

242
00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:29.900
Well, I think you answered the question.

243
00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:33.980
So how greedy are you if you know when it's enough?

244
00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:39.180
Everyone should fix a target for the profits that they want to take.

245
00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:42.680
